# Normalize all text to LF everywhere.
#
# The engine's tests replay byte-offset edits against large committed fixtures
# (500KCharsTest is 547 KB with 4,753 line breaks). With core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows and no attributes file, git checked those fixtures out as CRLF: every
# offset shifted and the windowed-morph assertions in Chars500kEdits.test.ts
# failed on Windows only. Pinning eol=lf makes the working tree byte-identical
# to CI on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never subject to eol conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wasm binary
